<title>USA: Raytel authorizes stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Raytel authorizes stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raytel Medical Corp said its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 100,000 shares of common stock on the open market during the next 12 months.</p>
<p>It said shares repurchased may be reissued to employees under the Employee Stock Purchase Plan or used for other corporate purposes.</p>
